QuestionText:
What is the output of: 
if True:
    print('Yes')
else:
    print('No')

What is the output of: 
for i in range(3):
    print(i)

What will be the output of:
if 5 > 2:
    print('Five is greater')

What is the output of:
for i in [1,2,3]:
    if i == 2:
        continue
    print(i)

What is the output of:
while False:
    print('Hello')

What is the output of:
if 'a' in 'apple':
    print('Found')
